@HayateOP.Samples.Endpoints_HostAddress = http://localhost:5185

### HayateOP management endpoints
### NOTE: per-pool endpoints resolve {type} via reflection (Type.GetType) and
### currently have a known limitation (tracked as T05). The overview and the
### DI-resolved pool endpoint below are the recommended working entry points.

### Management overview (works)
GET {{HayateOP.Samples.Endpoints_HostAddress}}/hayateop
Accept: application/json

###

### DI-resolved pool access (works) — recommended for per-pool operations
GET {{HayateOP.Samples.Endpoints_HostAddress}}/test-hayateop

###

### ASP.NET Core health check backed by HayateOpHealthCheck<T> (works)
GET {{HayateOP.Samples.Endpoints_HostAddress}}/health

###

### Per-pool detail (current limitation: needs an assembly-qualified type name
### and has a known issue — see README "Management Endpoints")
# GET {{HayateOP.Samples.Endpoints_HostAddress}}/hayateop/HayateOP.Samples.Endpoints.MyBizObj,HayateOP.Samples.Endpoints
